---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { GUIDE_RATE } from '../data/consultancy.js';
---
<SiteLayout title="Get a Free Initial AEO Plan | Agenquest" description={`Share your website for initial findings and a free 30-minute AEO call. Paid work is scoped separately, with a guide rate around ${GUIDE_RATE}.`}>
<div class="container page-intro"><div class="contact-grid"><div class="contact-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A useful place to start</p><h1>Let's build an initial AEO plan for your business.</h1><p class="lede">Share your website and contact details. We'll review the public information, then arrange a free 30-minute call to discuss initial findings, where the opportunity may be, and what useful work could look like.</p><p>You don't need to prepare a prompt list or know the AEO terminology.</p><p class="small">Free 30-minute call. Initial findings and a plan to discuss. No commitment.</p><p>Prefer email? Write to <a href="mailto:hello@agenquest.com">hello@agenquest.com</a>.</p></div>
<div><form id="inquiry-form" class="inquiry-form" method="post" action="/api/inquiry" data-clarity-mask="true" novalidate>
<div class="form-field"><label for="inquiry-website">Your website</label><input id="inquiry-website" name="website" type="text" inputmode="url" autocomplete="url" placeholder="yourbusiness.com" required maxlength="300" aria-describedby="website-error"/><p id="website-error" class="field-error" hidden></p></div>
<div class="form-field"><label for="inquiry-name">Your name</label><input id="inquiry-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120" aria-describedby="name-error"/><p id="name-error" class="field-error" hidden></p></div>
<div class="form-field"><label for="inquiry-email">Email address</label><input id="inquiry-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="254" aria-describedby="email-error"/><p id="email-error" class="field-error" hidden></p></div>
<div class="form-field"><label for="inquiry-message">Anything you'd like us to know? <span class="small">(optional)</span></label><textarea id="inquiry-message" name="message" rows="4" maxlength="2000" aria-describedby="message-help message-error"></textarea><p class="field-help" id="message-help">Tell us about your goals, a question you have, or a partnership idea. Up to 2,000 characters.</p><p id="message-error" class="field-error" hidden></p></div>
<div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="inquiry-fax">Leave this field empty</label><input id="inquiry-fax" name="fax" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></div>
<button class="button" id="inquiry-submit" type="submit">Request my free AEO plan</button><p class="form-notice">We'll use these details to respond to your inquiry and arrange the call. Read our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p><p id="inquiry-status" class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<noscript><p>The form needs JavaScript to send securely. Please email <a href="mailto:hello@agenquest.com">hello@agenquest.com</a> with your website and name.</p></noscript>
</form><div id="inquiry-success" class="form-success" tabindex="-1" hidden><h2>Thanks. We have your request.</h2><p>We'll review your website and email you to arrange the free 30-minute call. If you want to add anything, reply to our confirmation email or write to <a href="mailto:hello@agenquest.com">hello@agenquest.com</a>.</p><p class="small">Reference: <span id="inquiry-reference"></span></p></div></div></div>
<div class="contact-details"><h2>What the call includes</h2><ul><li>A discussion of your customers and how they discover your business.</li><li>Initial findings from a review of your public website and relevant AI answers.</li><li>A working hypothesis on what to improve first.</li><li>A discussion of scope, effort, and cost if you want help implementing it.</li></ul><p>This is an initial assessment. A full audit and implementation plan are scoped separately if needed.</p><h2>What does it cost?</h2><p>The first 30-minute call is free. Paid work depends on the scope, with a current guide rate of around {GUIDE_RATE}. We share an estimate and agree the work before starting. Third-party costs are discussed separately.</p><h2>Interested in partnering?</h2><p>Agencies, consultants, and other service providers are welcome to use the same form. Tell us where you think we could work together.</p><p>We offer exclusivity within your agreed niche. We'll define the boundaries together before the engagement starts.</p></div></div>
</SiteLayout>
<script>import '../scripts/inquiry-form.js';</script>
